{
    "title": "Real Drum electronic drums set",
    "description": "The Real Drum provides all the tools necessary to master the art of playing drums on your smartphone or tablet. Now you can easily play any music, anywhere! Experience the sensation of your fingers transforming into drumsticks and feel like part of a real band!\r\n\r\nWhat is a drum set?\r\nA drum set is a collection of drums, cymbals, and sometimes other percussion musical instruments arranged for one person to play. \r\n\r\nWhy haven't you started learning to play the drums yet?\r\nThe Real Drum offers various video lessons to assist you, along with a variety of loops to play along with.\r\n\r\nDon't have access to an acoustic drum set or electronic drums?\r\nNo problem! The Real Drum offers a diverse range of percussion musical instruments with high-quality sounds, allowing you to play any music you desire!\r\n\r\nYou don't need an acoustic drum set or electronic drums to learn to play!\r\nThe Real Drum is an excellent choice for practicing or playing drums quietly, without causing disruptions or requiring much space. Enjoy the freedom to play drums wherever you like!\r\n\r\nYou can customize the drum set to your liking!\r\nWith complete customization freedom, you can choose the number of drum pads and cymbals, their size, and their placement on the screen. This allows for a personalized drumming experience tailored to your preferences!\r\n\r\nShow your friends how good you are at playing drums!\r\nShare your drum kits and videos of your performances with friends and on social media!\r\n\r\nThe Real Drum app allows children and adults to learn drumming while having fun, enhancing their cognitive and motor skills. This drum game will stimulate your musical talent, making it easy to learn drum beats as if using a real drum kit.\r\n\r\nSo what are you waiting for to become a drummer?\r\n\r\nExplore Real Drum features:\r\n- Over 100 drum lessons to learn drumming\r\n- Various drum kits, including realistic 3D drums\r\n- Customize your drum set: upload your images and sounds and create your own drum set\r\n- Wide variety of drums, cymbals, and other musical percussion instruments\r\n- Loops for playing along\r\n- Studio-quality audio\r\n- Export your recordings to MP3 format\r\n- Share your recordings and custom drum sets on social media\r\n- New drum sets, drum lessons, and loops introduced weekly\r\n- Compatible with all screen resolutions \u2013 Phones and Tablets (HD images)\r\n- MIDI support\r\n- Free app\r\n\r\nTry out and enjoy the best drum and percussion game on Google Play! Designed for drummers, percussionists, professional musicians, enthusiasts, and beginners!\r\n\r\nDownload the Real Drum app and turn your fingers into drumsticks right now!\r\n\r\nFollow us on TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, and YouTube for tips on using the app: @kolbapps\r\n\r\nKolb Apps: Touch & Play!\r\n\r\nKeywords: real drums, drum machine, digital drum kit, digital drum set, digital drum pads, drum beats, drumming, drum lessons, drum rhythms, drum game, drum app, drum simulator, virtual drums, learn how to play drums, lear how to play percussion musical instruments, rudiments, drummer, 3D, drumsticks, electric drum set, electric drum kit, kids drum set, dram, drom, band, rock, heavy metal, reggae, pop, jazz, edm, blues, k-pop",
